Each dimension must be connected to the others. A dashboard displaying a hypothesis that the backend cannot reproduce is not acceptable. A remediation planner that does not use the evidence store is incomplete. A memory subsystem that stores unverified AI answers as facts is unsafe. A beautiful timeline whose historical values are fabricated is misleading.

